; [DA_PORT] Actor third-person visual per outfit.
;
; Why: Dead Air's outfit `actor_visual` (actors\legs\*.ogf) is a FIRST-PERSON body model
; (legs + torso only, no arms, no head) and cannot be used for the actor's shadow / death
; corpse. This maps each outfit section to a full NPC faction model (head + arms + matching
; armour) so the shadow and corpse show the real outfit with a head.
;
; The key is the OUTFIT section name; the value is a mesh path under gamedata\meshes (no .ogf).
; If an outfit is not listed here (or its model is missing) the engine falls back to the actor's
; config base visual (stalker_hero). Safe to edit and reload — no rebuild needed.

[da_actor_visual_3d]
novice_outfit            = actors\stalker_neutral\stalker_neutral_1
stalker_outfit           = actors\stalker_neutral\stalker_neutral_2
scientific_outfit        = actors\stalker_neutral\stalker_neutral_nauchniy_face_1
